Package: devjam-system-config-lowlatency
Version: 1.28-3
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Recommends: devjam-tools
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Low latency tools and settings for Debian
 Real-time limits and memory locking for the audio group, real-time
 priority and CPU affinity for PipeWire, access to /dev/cpu_dma_latency,
 and sysctl settings for swappiness and inotify watches.
